                 "text": "medium severity - CVE-2024-8391 Allocation of Resources Without Limits or Throttling vulnerability in pkg:maven\/io.vertx\/vertx-core@4.5.1"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "In Eclipse Vert.x version 4.3.0 to 4.5.9, the gRPC server does not limit the maximum length of message payload (Maven GAV: io.vertx:vertx-grpc-server and io.vertx:vertx-grpc-client).\u00A0\n\n\n\n\nThis is fixed in the 4.5.10 version.\u00A0\n\n\n\n\nNote this does not affect the Vert.x gRPC server based grpc-java and Netty libraries (Maven GAV: io.vertx:vertx-grpc)"
