          "ruleId": "CVE-2026-48748",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2026-48748 - Netty is a network application framework for development of protocol servers and clients. Prior to version 4.2.15.Final, a memory exhaustion vulnerability in the Netty HTTP\/3 codec allows the creation of an infinite number of blocked streams, which can cause OOM error. Version 4.2.15.Final patches the issue."
