          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2019-20444 - HttpObjectDecoder.java in Netty before 4.1.44 allows an HTTP header that lacks a colon, which might be interpreted as a separate header with an incorrect syntax, or might be interpreted as an \"invalid fold.\""
